  <body font-size="9" font-family="Helvetica">

    <!-- Appendix A Section -->
    <h2 align="center">Appendix A – Preventative Maintenance – Scope of Works</h2>
    <p>
      Specified Preventative Maintenance scope of works should be completed to the contracted frequencies.
      The scope of works for each asset is contained within the appropriate Preventative Maintenance checklist below.
      Please ensure the below checklists are completed alongside each Preventative Maintenance service, signed,
      and provided with the invoice as per Special Condition Section 15.6.
    </p>
    <br/>

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="4">
      <tr>
        <td width="50%"><b>Company</b></td>
        <td width="50%">${companyName}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td width="50%"><b>Company Logo &amp; Name to be entered</b></td>
        <td width="50%">${logo}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td width="50%"><b>Store Name</b></td>
        <td width="50%">${storeName}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td width="50%"><b>Date of Service</b></td>
        <td width="50%">${dateOfService}</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <br/>

    <!-- General Instructions -->
    <table width="100%" border="1" cellpadding="4">
      <tr>
        <td background-color="#f2f2f2"><b>General Items</b></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>
          When arriving to/ departing from site the technician must sign into Rapid Global or equivalent ALDI Contractor Management System (CMS).<br/>
          The technician must check into ServiceChannel and then checkout upon completion.<br/>
          Enquire with staff as to performance of system and any specific issues that need attention.<br/>
          Record and notify store staff of any issues that need to be addressed.
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <br/>

