      <tr><td>Check the failsafe mechanism/inverter system</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Check microcomputer control unit and adjust if necessary</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Check alignment and tune the photo electric beams and activation sensors</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
